Q5OydPuqfRAvKn0QLw\"/><figcaption>台灣知名媒體人慘遭「年輕貌美女乘客」斥喝趕下高鐵　劇情神展開（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"台灣知名媒體人慘遭「年輕貌美女乘客」斥喝趕下高鐵　劇情神展開（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250305/973922327001829376269081.jpeg/r-8knk4mk83Hn-le4L8S5JT8soIOCP3L4YYf4OGGH-A\"/><figcaption>台灣知名媒體人慘遭「年輕貌美女乘客」斥喝趕下高鐵　劇情神展開（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"楊月娥分享的照片（Facebook@楊月娥）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250305/973922330055413760539240.jpeg/otWnIqL-w3iFVXOSYplv69mr22gCGB2AvayLtL2si7Q\"/><figcaption>楊月娥分享的照片（Facebook@楊月娥）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"台灣知名媒體人慘遭「年輕貌美女乘客」斥喝趕下高鐵　劇情神展開（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250305/973922328952311808394251.jpeg/TwDqfNumsI8Peo3pX26EdyuVpKRTYESvkdHhbZHR4W0\"/><figcaption>台灣知名媒體人慘遭「年輕貌美女乘客」斥喝趕下高鐵　劇情神展開（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><p>BIGBANG太寵粉！小VIP「1打扮」場外應援　獲贈搖滾區門票</p><p>【本文獲「TVBS新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-12T07:42:56.317489+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":2361,"images":37,"source":"HK01 熱話","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-12T06:30:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-12T08:17:55.143812+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-12T07:37:47.816299+00:00","content_hash":"6dd586caf038cef1b5db1ebc855c1989c65a734d91be47e79114173ce854471b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}